<title>FRANCE: Cie des Signaux 1996 profits rise.</title>
<headline>Cie des Signaux 1996 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>Net attributable before amortisation of capital gains</p>
<p>						     286   vs   60</p>
<p>    Pretax, pre-exceptional		   96   vs  101</p>
<p>    Exceptional			profit  174   vs   19 loss</p>
<p>    Net attrib excluding exceptionals    112   vs   79</p>
<p>Net attrib per share excluding exceptionals</p>
<p>					 (francs)  22.4  vs  15.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				    1,939  vs 2,100</p>
<p>NOTE - Electronics firm Cie des Signaux said in a statement that it was proposing a net dividend of 5.50 francs and a gross dividend of 2.75 francs.</p>
<p>Completion of the acquisition of Ritzenthaler and Cisi should permit it to post annual turnover of nearly four billion francs. It was also pursuing technological and commericial alliances such as the accord it signed at the start of 1997 with U.S. Robotics.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
